{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門寶田邨有人倒斃。今日（28日）下午4時13分，警方接獲一名59歲姓朱男子的家人報案，指懷疑朱男在寶田邨第7座住所內暈倒。</p><p>救援人員接報趕至現場，經檢驗後證實朱男已當場死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。據了解，死者有精神病記錄。</p><figure><img alt=\"案發現場是寶田邨第7座。(資料圖片/王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211115/537044100688384000529168.jpeg/q5jazQeugRWRFiDV5aMV296sPqxy5uX2kGpsf7pqbH8\"/><figcaption>案發現場是寶田邨第7座。(資料圖片/王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T14:40:00.358960+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T14:14:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:53:58.064599+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:33:28.135111+00:00","content_hash":"6f919507923de3e372757f1845dcaed2efb8872c08df5962163881dfe0fa7f6c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}